    "pc_requirements": {
        "minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> 10 or older<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> core i5-750<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 1 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GT 650M<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 200 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> just have any<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Anything not pre-2000s should work fine. Even Karen's computer. Anyway, depending on the game mode (number of players in game) physics simulation can be power-intensive.</li></ul>"
